{"id":"655981","name":"芋头糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/655981/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香芋","amount":"650g"},{"name":"广式腊肠","amount":"150g"},{"name":"粘米粉","amount":"600g"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"虾米","amount":"15g"},{"name":"炒花生米","amount":"50g"},{"name":"熟芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香芋削皮。","img":"images/655981/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成长丝。","img":"images/655981/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"配料：腊肠、虾米、花生仁。","img":"images/655981/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"粘米粉和玉米淀粉拌一起。","img":"images/655981/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加上清水调成酸奶状。","img":"images/655981/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧油，倒入腊肠丁炒至干香。","img":"images/655981/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入虾米炒香。","img":"images/655981/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入芋头丝炒软。","img":"images/655981/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入盐、糖、十三香和鸡精。","img":"images/655981/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"拌匀入味。","img":"images/655981/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"转至小火，倒入粉浆。","img":"images/655981/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻拌凝固后关火。","img":"images/655981/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"撒入花生米拌匀。","img":"images/655981/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"准备一个方形的不锈钢盆，底部垫上油纸放便脱模，或刷上油也一样。","img":"images/655981/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"全部倒入盆内，压至平实。","img":"images/655981/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"水开入锅蒸40分钟，如浅一点的盆可缩短时间。","img":"images/655981/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"时间到。","img":"images/655981/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"撒上熟芝麻，彻底放凉后才能脱模。","img":"images/655981/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"脱模后切成小块，可直接吃，也可加热煎着吃。","img":"images/655981/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"煎至表面微黄更香。","img":"images/655981/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。泡上一壶清茶配上芋头糕，平淡简单的日子最美。","img":"images/655981/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}